<title>FRANCE: Total French mobile phones over 2 mln in Oct.</title>
<headline>Total French mobile phones over 2 mln in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total of French mobile phone subscriptions rose to over two million in October, the ministry for telecommunications said.</p>
<p>It said the total was up by 132,400 in the month, or 6.7 percent, to 2,120,200.</p>
<p>Digital GSM telephones made up the lion's share, rising by 141,000 or eight percent to 1,893,400.</p>
<p>France Telecom's Itineris unit registered an increase of 63,200 to 1,154,300, Generale des Eaux's SFR unit had a 59,500 increase to 660,300 while Bouygues Telecom advanced 15,900 to 60,700.</p>
</text>
